@end deftp

@deftp {Record Field} parent
@type{(or false? vcomponent?)}
@default{#f}
@end deftp

@end deftp

@defun children vcomponent
Returns all direct children of vcomponent, as a list of vcomponents.

Note that this list isn't ordered, and may change from run to run (or
any other time).
@end defun

@defun add-child parent child
Returns a new component, which is identical to @var{parent}, except
with @var{child} added to its set of children.
@end defun

@defun prop* component key
@defunx prop* component key vline
Get or set a complete vline on a component.
@end defun

@defun prop component key
@defunx prop component key value
Get or set the value of a given vline on a component.
Any pre-existing parameters will be left as is.
@end defun

@deffn {Lens} prop% key
Focus the given vline on a component. If the property doesn't exist,
then it will be created.

Named with a @code{%} instead of @code{*} due to the later already
being used be the accessor.
@end deffn


@defun {(extract field)} vcomponent
@defunx {(extract* field)} vcomponent
Curried version of @var{prop}.
@end defun


